---
layout: layouts/feature.njk
wide: true
playgroundCta: true
hideBreadcrumbs: true
title: Funzionalità | Shellui
description: "Costruisci web app con navigazione, accesso, amministrazione e storage condivisi. Esplora Shellui, shell microfrontend open source."
heading: "Costruisci la tua app. Condividi l'essenziale."
lede: "Shellui è una shell open source che unisce le web app con navigazione, accesso, amministrazione e storage condivisi. Le app girano in iframe con i framework che scegli."
---

<div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(0,0.9fr)] lg:gap-16">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Una base condivisa per le tue applicazioni web</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Costruisci un portale clienti, uno strumento interno o un prodotto con più app. Configura navigazione, layout e servizi collegati in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">shellui.config.json</code>. Ogni app mantiene la propria UI e usa l'SDK Shellui per le funzionalità condivise.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Parti da navigazione e layout, poi collega autenticazione o storage quando serve. Shellui è MIT e gratuito da eseguire. Puoi ospitare shell e servizi sulla tua infrastruttura.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Esplora le funzionalità sotto, oppure prova il <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="{{ site.playground }}">Playground</a> nel browser prima di installare qualcosa.</p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
      <a href="/architecture/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Architettura</a>
      ·
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Docs</a>
      ·
      <a href="{{ site.playground }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Playground</a>
      ·
      <a href="/changelog/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:text-primary">Changelog</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div>
    {% include "feature-visual-shell.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6">
  {% for item in featurePages %}
    <a
      id="{{ item.id }}"
      href="{{ item.href }}"
      class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary lg:col-span-2{% if loop.index == 4 %} lg:col-start-2{% endif %}{% if loop.last %} sm:max-w-[calc(50%-0.75rem)] sm:justify-self-center lg:max-w-none lg:justify-self-stretch{% endif %}"
    >
      <div class="border-b border-border bg-muted p-4 sm:p-5">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[16rem] {% if item.visual == 'auth' %}max-w-[13rem]{% endif %}">
          {% if item.visual == "shell-layout" %}
            {% include "shell-layout-anim.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "auth" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-auth.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "admin" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-admin.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "storage" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-storage.njk" %}
          {% elif item.visual == "ship" %}
            {% include "feature-visual-ship.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-foreground">{{ item.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">{{ item.benefit }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          {% for point in item.points %}
            <li>{{ point }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">{{ item.cta }}</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
